a&_nc_ohc=6qljp6vopXoQ7kNvwE_aUu1&_nc_oc=AdraYTGN-4B9Hwe6OxKam7Jow8jVYT-08kJZk0Ajr5biRnAo4wXoNIQznIDp9wOZCno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFMrLmRzeJHCOw07J5bD1db7MeK6CycFNm8B3FzsCBfXA&oe=6A901506"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_007_0003.png", "id": "845763184505694", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_845763187839027_468447991220621964_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uTPhAM1RurYQ7kNvwEKtiwt&_nc_oc=AdooTZhWGFQ5lk4IJWzFhEXBzaOVFV1owrlLql_mABkGVq7KzS2Eh2vxkwbNPT2R7Xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFDqkDolaBVIq-_w6qEtQxs4Yx1FzA69KGyJbvFFoPmZg&oe=6A903AAC"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0002.png", "id": "1836602476962685", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1836602480296018_8280261062432359374_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kEvnlIrt2dEQ7kNvwEUavKr&_nc_oc=AdpVpIS8Abblavz873yFlWvEhUjAx6qFUeSVOGJdSrKnla-XrSS4bngyWefe603KaUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF44FUhBRmoTsX-w0sp6dzrWt9QUpbE70RYY0lbwjSlNw&oe=6A903783"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "1138993271704566", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1138993275037899_3311993198849045458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GJ4RQcSqnz4Q7kNvwFkO0gV&_nc_oc=AdpKSP7hRhyWO9eYNSH2EfwV4VolSUyiTBgUSnDlzipz1R_5qNzIWHF0W1EOtcIgmwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEa_cK9aIZ2c-ohoRrvIn-Ei-AR-PDu-A8KkcfZt3OBUQ&oe=6A903A93"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0001.png", "id": "847449181015275", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_847449184348608_15613528115627936_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N_xWBu1e8rwQ7kNvwHSahzU&_nc_oc=AdrKp8B_Lc_4gWMhoRS_i-FlrYVJXv2tBc65ZVglDMrBDqhXv1iY45Ct8I6hEHeE8j8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH74TsqrEcls2qYfefmL5XcgX-_UPo3HCA_dDU9vYiY1Q&oe=6A903401"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zibby", "keywords": ["social", "casual", "free", "gorilla", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Zibby!\n\nZibby is not just game. Zibby is lifestyle. Enter the world, be the Zibby.\n\n# Bonk & Snack\nSee that Spitflower? It has gems inside. BONK the Spitflower. Gem falls out? Don't put in pocket. EAT IT. Crunchy victory.\n\n{847821848000023}\n\n# Shop Like a Boss\nWhy look boring? Go to store. We have everything! Buy funny hat. Buy cool gadget. Buy shiny things. Look fresh, impress friends. Spend your hard-earned cash here.\n\n{1280599737210708}\n\n# Dig Deep, Eat Dark\nGrab pickaxe. Find rock. Smash rock! Oh look, coal pieces! Are you hungry? Yes. Eat the coal. Mining is tasty work.\n\n{2308405566240054}\n\n# Zoom and Boing\nWalking is for slow people. Use Jumppad: BOING! Fly high. Use Zipline: WHOOSH! Go fast. Explore the world like a pro. Never touch ground again.\n\n{722552094239314}\n\n# The Circle of Life\nSimple life. Good life. Walk -> Grab -> Bonk Mob -> EAT. Mine Rock -> Get Coal -> EAT. -> Sell loot -> Get rich -> Repeat. This is the Zibby way.\n\n{3001593293368798}\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"